/* 大世界街巷事件库 卷3 / 港区·小巷·海滩·森林日常与NPC偶遇 / 零编号命名 */

:: MP World Mer AnchorBollardBag [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "mer">>
<<effects>>
<<set _exitPas to ($mpReturnPassage or "Mer Street")>>
<<if _exitPas is "Start" or _exitPas is "Start2" or _exitPas.startsWith("MP ")>>
	<<set _exitPas to "Mer Street">>
<</if>>
梅尔街海员俱乐部外侧的锚链桩下塞着一只防水帆布袋。
<<mpAmbient>><<if Weather.precipitation is "rain">>雨声掩去了响动。<<else>>四周静谧无声。<</if>>
<<if ($stress or 0) gte 3500>>你深呼吸稳住心神。<<else>>你全神贯注地观察。<</if>>
你在夹层与暗槽间摸到了一枚保存完好的旧银币与信物线索。
<br><br>
<<investigateicon>><<link [[上前仔细查探 (0:05)|_exitPas]]>><<pass 5>><<stress -4>><<money 220>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>><<lstress>>
<br>
<<if ($skulduggery or 0) gte 250>>
	<<sneakicon>><<link [[巧妙开启暗格 (0:04)|_exitPas]]>><<pass 4>><<set $mpAntiquesUnappraised to ($mpAntiquesUnappraised or 0) + 1>><<skulduggery 2>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
	<br>
<</if>>
<<walkicon>><<link [[不动声色地离开 (0:02)|_exitPas]]>><<pass 2>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>

:: MP World Elk PulleyRailPadlock [nobr]
<<set $outside to 1>><<set $location to "elk">>
<<effects>>
<<set _exitPas to ($mpReturnPassage or "Elk Street")>>
<<if _exitPas is "Start" or _exitPas is "Start2" or _exitPas.startsWith("MP ")>>
	<<set _exitPas to "Elk Street">>
<</if>>
麋鹿街三号仓库的滑轮导轨槽里卡着一只黄铜挂锁与钥匙串。
<<mpAmbient>><<if Time.dayState is "night">>夜深无人察觉。<<else>>光线照亮了纹理。<</if>>
<<if ($exposed or 0) gte 1>>微凉的气流拂过皮肤，你借阴影掩护身形。<<else>>你整理好衣摆上前查看。<</if>>
你拨开外侧的遮挡，发现底部藏着前人留下的暗记与零散钱币。
<br><br>
<<investigateicon>><<link [[上前仔细查探 (0:05)|_exitPas]]>><<pass 5>><<stress -4>><<money 220>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>><<lstress>>
<br>
<<if ($skulduggery or 0) gte 250>>
	<<sneakicon>><<link [[巧妙开启暗格 (0:04)|_exitPas]]>><<pass 4>><<set $mpAntiquesUnappraised to ($mpAntiquesUnappraised or 0) + 1>><<skulduggery 2>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>
	<br>
<</if>>
<<walkicon>><<link [[不动声色地离开 (0:02)|_exitPas]]>><<pass 2>><<set $eventskip to 1>><<endevent>><</link>>

